Will You Ever ?

I could write a whole novel about you.
But will you ever read it?
Will you ever know it exists?
Will you ever buy it?
Will you ever recognize the author?
Will you ever understand his intentions?
Will you ever ?

Just in case you need to know,
I am writing a novel.
Will you become a main character in it?
Will you share your story?
Will you share the part of me that lives in your life,
In case I become someone in yours?
Will you ever ?

Out of this delusion,
Will you ever recognize
The eyes that follow you?
Will you ever realize that someone
Seeks excuses to talk to you?
Will you ever respond to my actions?
Will you ever become my friend?
Will you ever?

Will you ever !